、なんだよ。全部聞いてたんじゃねえか！","nextNodeIds":[751420714]},{"nodeId":751420714,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":1768159354,"text":"トゥゼーの声が大きすぎるんだよ。今度から内緒話をするときは、こしょこしょ話ね。","nextNodeIds":[751420715]},{"nodeId":751420715,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21765,"speakerName":"トゥゼー","textMapHash":4230475690,"text":"わかったよ…えっ。でも、そ、それ、めちゃくちゃ近くならねえか！？","nextNodeIds":[751420716]},{"nodeId":751420716,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":2410184586,"text":"あははっ、そうかもね。えっと…こんにちは、異郷の大英雄さん。わたしはトゥナイアで、こっちがおばかのトゥゼーです。","nextNodeIds":[751420717]},{"nodeId":751420717,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21765,"speakerName":"トゥゼー","textMapHash":3941942642,"text":"またおれのこと「ばか」って言った…","nextNodeIds":[751420718]},{"nodeId":751420718,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":2002470474,"text":"豊穣の邦へようこそ、テペトル仔竜も…あれっ、聖山様の具合が悪いからかな…集落にはよその竜を退ける「符石」があるはずなのに…","nextNodeIds":[751420719]},{"nodeId":751420719,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21765,"speakerName":"トゥゼー","textMapHash":2088138186,"text":"へへっ、符石も叩いて治してやらないとな！","nextNodeIds":[751420720]},{"nodeId":751420720,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":1281649066,"text":"今一番叩いて治さないといけないのはトゥゼーの頭のほうじゃない？…それにしても、大英雄さんが「豊穣の邦」まで来てくれるなんて…","nextNodeIds":[751420721]},{"nodeId":751420721,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":994217818,"text":"なにかお困りですか？","nextNodeIds":[751420722]},{"nodeId":751420722,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":3406064338,"text":"トゥナイアとトゥゼーに聖山に入る目的を説明した…","nextNodeIds":[751420723]},{"nodeId":751420723,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":788336722,"text":"「聖山に入りたい」、ですか…難しいと思いますよ。大人たちはいつも「聖山は危険な場所だから気軽に入るな」って言ってますし…","nextNodeIds":[751420724]},{"nodeId":751420724,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":2703693474,"text":"#でも、{NICKNAME}さんが聖山に入りたがるからには、きっとそれなりの理由があるんですよね…","nextNodeIds":[751420725]},{"nodeId":751420725,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":1023237338,"text":"うーん…聖山に入ったことがある人なら知ってますよ。","nextNodeIds":[751420726]},{"nodeId":751420726,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21765,"speakerName":"トゥゼー","textMapHash":1501827282,"text":"お、おれも知ってるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[751420727]},{"nodeId":751420727,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3596054146,"text":"えっ、でも…聖山って部族の大事な場所なんだろ？そんな気軽にオイラたちに教えちゃっていいのか？","nextNodeIds":[751420728]},{"nodeId":751420728,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":2188163410,"text":"「聖山」っていうのは、遥か昔のウォーベンに載っていた呼び方をそのまま使ってるだけです…わたしたちにとっては、「聖火競技場」のほうが神聖ですよ。","nextNodeIds":[751420729]},{"nodeId":751420729,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":4231735266,"text":"入っちゃいけないのは、ただ危ないからってだけですよ。","nextNodeIds":[751420730]},{"nodeId":751420730,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21765,"speakerName":"トゥゼー","textMapHash":2236708754,"text":"しかも、昔火山の中を探索するために、「談議室」が探検隊を組んだこともあるんだぜ！へへ、おれも大きくなったら絶対遊びに行くんだ！","nextNodeIds":[751420731]},{"nodeId":751420731,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":2169637562,"text":"もう、危ないって何回言ったらわかるの…","nextNodeIds":[751420732]},{"nodeId":751420732,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":3022731282,"text":"うーん…わたしも詳しくは知らないんですけど、よかったら<color=#00E1FFFF>エンポゾお爺ちゃん</color>に聞いてみてください。きっと喜んで助けてくれると思います。","nextNodeIds":[751420733]},{"nodeId":751420733,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21765,"speakerName":"トゥゼー","textMapHash":3406242426,"text":"暇そうにぶらぶらしてるエンポゾ爺ちゃんか…？それより<color=#00E1FFFF>キモシー</color>に聞いた方が早いぜ。へへっ、キモシーはおれのおじさんなんだ。昔探検隊のメンバーだったんだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[751420734]},{"nodeId":751420734,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":916828378,"text":"エンポゾお爺ちゃんは暇でぶらぶらしてるわけじゃないの。うーん、片方は<color=#00E1FFFF>山の南側にある採掘現場</color>、もう片方は<color=#00E1FFFF>村の西側にあるテフラ遺跡</color>にいます…ただ…","nextNodeIds":[751420735]},{"nodeId":751420735,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":1480952554,"text":"案内してあげたいところなんですが、今は聖山様の活動期なので…わたしたちは一緒に行けないんです…","nextNodeIds":[751420736]},{"nodeId":751420736,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4082497098,"text":"大丈夫だ。いろいろ教えてくれただけで十分だぞ！","nextNodeIds":[751420737]},{"nodeId":751420737,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3651993842,"text":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}！戻ってこーい！出発するぞ！","nextNodeIds":[751420738]},{"nodeId":751420738,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":1831219074,"text":"キュイ！","nextNodeIds":[751420739]},{"nodeId":751420739,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21766,"speakerName":"トゥナイア","textMapHash":4059672138,"text":"えへへ、かわいいですね。しっぽに巻いてあるスカーフが素敵。聖山様が眠ったら、部族の外で一緒に遊びましょう！","nextNodeIds":[751420740]},{"nodeId":751420740,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":715731346,"text":"もちろん！今度は遊ぼうな！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7514205,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7514207,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7514901,1],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE",